<deviceset name="ESP32-S3-ZERO" prefix="U">
<description>&lt;b&gt;Waveshare ESP32-S3-Zero Microcontroller Board&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Compact ESP32-S3FH4R2 Development Board with 24 exposed GPIOs, castellated holes, 2.54mm pitch, USB-C, 4MB Flash, and 2MB PSRAM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="https://docs.waveshare.com/ESP32-S3-Zero"&gt;Waveshare ESP32-S3-Zero Documentation&lt;/a&gt;</description>
